You said the reporters are not allowed to go around on the expedition.

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:54.380
Was it Nelson at the conference he's holding now?

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:59.980
I'm sure you're all curious as to just why you won't be allowed to go on this expedition.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:03.680
It's a question of efficiency.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.400
It means that no one goes along unless they're needed.

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.540
Are you implying that the press would merely be in the way?

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:13.900
Under other circumstances, I know I would require you to help.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.360
As it is now, the press will have to trust us.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:19.540
Our bulletins will be released daily.

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:21.100
Why are you wasting your time out here?

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.990
Well, why waste it in there listening to Nelson's double talk?

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.440
Miss Nelson, who is he anyway?

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:29.960
Well, the expedition...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.530
Well, I know that. Who is he, though?

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:35.690
He doesn't look like a scientist.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:40.850
He's hiding anything. Why else no reporters?

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:43.280
I bet that's it.

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.750
And so?

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:49.660
That's it.

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:50.920
And is that all?

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:53.150
Wasn't you an idea?

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:54.610
Oh, no, I was just...

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:02.320
Thank you.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:31.000
I'll see you next time.

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:35.150
