00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:40.160
Absurd. He isn't a scientist. He couldn't evaluate such information.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.280
Beginning to suspect there's more to him than meets the eye.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:58.240
Who's there?

