Start talking. What are you doing here?

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:05.270
Oh, I was dusting, sir.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:11.780
Dusting and using bat?

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:14.120
Found it here, sir.

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:16.220
Ruck.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:25.440
Shimbun star reporter has turned into a cabin boy, huh?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:27.710
in the Arctic.

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:37.380
Wait a minute. You don't suppose I'd really let you just walk out now?

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.220
What are you doing here?

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:45.900
I'd like to ask you the same.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:54.240
