00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:55.600
My orders are clear.

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:59.020
I see. Orders of the Rolissian government.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:01.530
No, not exactly. They're my orders.

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:02.780
Ben, I'll ignore them.

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:06.370
Let's go.

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:26.910
the act of area.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.220
Check your protection.

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:32.230
Ah, Dr. Harada, everything all right?

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:33.590
Thanks.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:38.450
I see you'll talk Nelson out of throwing the reporter into the brig, sir.

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:42.120
Yes, he has joined us as a guard.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.660
I have his word he won't act as journalist while he's here.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:49.060
Well, I guess now I must have new cards printed.

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:54.190
Here, old ones.

00:17:58.150 --> 00:17:59.920
There's nothing we can do about this.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.020
Dictator, Mr. Nautson.

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:01.970
No.

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:05.470
As far as I can tell you when Dr. Rock refers to him.

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:07.070
Isn't that rather odd?

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:07.840
You know?

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:09.390
I wonder if there's any...

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:10.110
That is...

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:13.560
Sorry, doctor.

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:14.960
God.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:22.570
I'm about to go ashore.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:26.300
Expedition is going into an area where there is some danger.

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:29.560
Radiation injury, as you know, is not to be taken lightly.

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:33.820
However, it has been minimized by your protective equipment, which is thoroughly reliable.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.070
And if you act comely and carefully...

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:37.500
No emergency should arise.

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:43.060
On your right chest strap is an emergency button which will set off a siren alarm if the unexpected does occur.

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:44.770
Allow me to wish you good luck.

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:46.070
Thank you.

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:05.610
Thank you.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:00.770
Connect the gear.

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:31.950
Bye.

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:01.540
wrong

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:15.900
You're off.

