00:23:15.030 --> 00:23:16.870
Those beauties, those two girls.

00:23:18.220 --> 00:23:18.620
Beauties?

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:20.700
Sure, to the press, at any rate.

00:23:21.180 --> 00:23:23.040
Unless they're terrible, they're always beauties.

